    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>Charts here are identification aids. They are not a substitute for the tap maker’s table, a print, or a gauge.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>75% thread is a shop default, not a strength calculation.</li>
      <li>Hard or thin material may need a different percentage.</li>
      <li>NPT is tapered pipe, not a machine screw.</li>
      <li>Bits break. Wear eye protection. Do not hold small work in your hand.</li>
    </ul>
